        <mxCell id="n13" parent="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#003116;strokeWidth=4.0;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color:#0070c0;font-size:24px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;About project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#0070c0;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#ff0000;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;The project is based on providing CHARGING SERVICE to EV’s when they get out of charge in region far from charging stations.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90.7" width="555.6" x="432.8" y="117.2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n14" parent="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#ffccff;fillOpacity=30;strokeColor=#c00000;strokeWidth=4.0;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color:#ff0000;font-size:24px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;Assumptions made for Project:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#ff0066;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;1. There is a emergency service available to contact the mobile.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#ff0066;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;2.Wireless Charging Technology has became Efficient. And wireless charging is widely used for EV’s.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#ff0066;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;3. Autonomous Vehicles are commonly used as Taxi’s and common use.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="216.8" width="396.8" x="434.6" y="234.3" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n15" parent="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#ffffcc;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=4.0;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;PROBLEM:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt; What if EV’s get discharged in regions like Mountains, desert’s, forest area or a place from where the charging station is far away.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#00b050;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;SOLUTION:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt; We will require something which will go that place and charge that EV, here where our wireless EV charging Mobile comes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="215.4" width="378" x="37.8" y="196.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n16" parent="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#ffffcc;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=4.0;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=5;spacingRight=5;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color:#c00000;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;PROBLEM:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt; What if EV’s get discharged in between a highway or road and causing traffic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#00b050;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;SOLUTION: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;A Towing mechanism is required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;font-size:19px;font-family:Times New Roman;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
